OL,3,GNEWSARebecca Jackson on life in
OL,4,Amale-dominated motorsport
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen racing driver Rebecca Jackson
OL,7,Ffirst joined online car forums, she
OL,8,Fused only her surname to avoid being
OL,9,Fpre-judged for her gender.
OL,11,FIt was not until her first real-life
OL,12,Fmeet that her cover was blown. "I got
OL,13,Fout of the car and they went, 'Oh,
OL,14,FJackson's a girl,'" she said.
OL,16,FUsed to "male-dominated environments"
OL,17,Fand "mickey taking" thanks to her dad's
OL,18,Fwork as an engineer, she said she
OL,19,Fsimply replied: "Yeah, Jackson's a
OL,20,Fgirl."
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
